lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nChen Yu attends an important interview, this job is what she dreams of and thinks about day and night. After the interview, she is told that she is not selected.\n\n[Question]\nChen Yu should feel disappointed, but she actually feels very excited, why is this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Chen Yu learns that she is not selected because of an internal referral issue, not because of her ability, so she feels excited about the company's career development prospects.\nB. Chen Yu thinks the feedback from the interviewer is very useful, she believes this failure helps her get better opportunities in other positions.\nC. Chen Yu actually does not want this job, she only attends the interview due to family pressure.\nD. The interviewer tells Chen Yu that her performance is excellent, they decide to create a new position for her.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021826393112717338,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b26c2ddb05a7fe2fb11","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452262275,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"579b45cf1abe44f2bac1725b09992ee7"}